From bb130b1224bc5715a9764a1955fa1998183e5cf4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:44:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 20/22] Move: the save format goes from game-state.js to
 game/js/logic/saves.js

8 names, same code (move-names.mjs verify: 7 statements moved): SAVE_VERSION, newSave, newSaveKeepingPreferences,
migrate, saveAge, loadSave, SAVE_OLD_MSG and SAVE_NEW_MSG. game-state.js keeps where a save is kept (localStorage,
SAVE_FOUND, saveHold) and still makes saveData at load with loadSave/newSave, now imported. saves.js comes right
after rules.js; it reads saveData (newSaveKeepingPreferences) through hooks.js. Only the constants SAVE_VERSION and
the two messages are made at load.

Checked: lint, check:modules, format, build, smoke 14/14 (168 s).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LpFSn4GaodAVzjKW5J3oQR
